{"id":"4095490ed42eb546","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-adelic.md","title":"Adeles","display":"df-adelic — Adeles","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adelic","aliases":["58-df-adelic","Adeles"],"display":"df-adelic — Adeles","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adelic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adelic</span><span>Adeles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adelic — Adeles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb A,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb A,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is an explicitly supplied index set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\bullet(v)=\\langle K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\rangle\">\\(K_\\bullet(v)=\\langle K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\rangle\\)</span> packages a local field and an embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_v:K\\to K_v\">\\(\\iota_v:K\\to K_v\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_\\bullet(v)\\subseteq K_v\">\\(O_\\bullet(v)\\subseteq K_v\\)</span> is explicitly supplied distinguished-subring data.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> are the predicates from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(K_\\bullet,P,\\operatorname{ran}(K_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(O_\\bullet,P,\\operatorname{ran}(O_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall v\\in P\\;\\exists K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_\\bullet(v)=\\langle K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_v,K,K_v)\n\\land O_\\bullet(v)\\subseteq K_v\n\\land0_v,1_v\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\n\\bigl(+_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in O_\\bullet(v)\n\\land\\cdot_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall a\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\\exists b\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\n\\bigl(+_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=0_v\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathbb A=\\Bigl\\{x:\n\\mathrm{Function}\\Bigl(x,P,\\bigcup_{v\\in P}\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall v\\in P\\;\\bigl(x(v)\\in\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:x(v)\\notin O_\\bullet(v)\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(K_\\bullet,P,\\operatorname{ran}(K_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(O_\\bullet,P,\\operatorname{ran}(O_\\bullet))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall v\\in P\\;\\exists K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_\\bullet(v)=\\langle K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_v,K,K_v)\n\\land O_\\bullet(v)\\subseteq K_v\n\\land0_v,1_v\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\n\\bigl(+_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in O_\\bullet(v)\n\\land\\cdot_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall a\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\\exists b\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\n\\bigl(+_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=0_v\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathbb A=\\Bigl\\{x:\n\\mathrm{Function}\\Bigl(x,P,\\bigcup_{v\\in P}\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall v\\in P\\;\\bigl(x(v)\\in\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:x(v)\\notin O_\\bullet(v)\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a relative presentation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>, the local-field packages, their embeddings, and the distinguished subrings are data, not objects silently generated by an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Places}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Places}_S\\)</span> operation.</li>\n<li>Coordinatewise operations read from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\bullet\">\\(K_\\bullet\\)</span> make the displayed restricted-product carrier a ring.</li>\n<li>Certifying that these packages are precisely the completions and valuation rings of a particular global field is a separate upstream construction.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weil, Basic Number Theory</li>\n<li>Ramakrishnan and Valenza, Fourier Analysis on Number Fields</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb A,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\bullet(v)=\\langle K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_v:K\\to K_v","display":false},{"tex":"O_\\bullet(v)\\subseteq K_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A,K,P,K_\\bullet,O_\\bullet)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(K_\\bullet,P,\\operatorname{ran}(K_\\bullet))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(O_\\bullet,P,\\operatorname{ran}(O_\\bullet))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall v\\in P\\;\\exists K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nK_\\bullet(v)=\\langle K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v,\\iota_v\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K_v,+_v,\\cdot_v,0_v,1_v)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_v,K,K_v)\n\\land O_\\bullet(v)\\subseteq K_v\n\\land0_v,1_v\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\n\\bigl(+_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in O_\\bullet(v)\n\\land\\cdot_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall a\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\\exists b\\in O_\\bullet(v)\\;\n\\bigl(+_v(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=0_v\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathbb A=\\Bigl\\{x:\n\\mathrm{Function}\\Bigl(x,P,\\bigcup_{v\\in P}\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall v\\in P\\;\\bigl(x(v)\\in\\pi_0(K_\\bullet(v))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{v\\in P:x(v)\\notin O_\\bullet(v)\\}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Places}_S","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\bullet","display":false}],"bytes":2448,"backlinks":[{"id":"38dd011a65e9bf42","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea947a923b719818","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (adele-ring predicate, see [[58-df-adelic]])"},{"id":"9b559d9a72ff847c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AdeleRing}_S(\\mathbb A_K,K,P,\\mathbf K,\\mathbf O)$ (set-coded adele ring, see [[58-df-adelic]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-adelic.md|58-df-adelic]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}